" newtab is handled by mozilla.cfg autoconfig, not Tridactyl
" using the no-new-tab variant of Tridactyl

" Disable Tridactyl on pages where it interferes with native UI.
" addons.mozilla.org: Tridactyl's key/focus handling dismisses the
" extension install permission prompt before it can be confirmed.
autocmd DocStart addons.mozilla.org mode ignore
" Stylus's own pages (settings, editor) — let them use normal keys
autocmd DocStart .*moz-extension://.*stylus.* mode ignore
